; Tutorial_6_Follow_Related_Records.inix -- moving between related tables.

[about]
Title=6 - Follow Related Records
Intro=From a record into the records related to it with Alt plus Right Arrow, and back with Alt plus Left Arrow, as a browser goes back.
Setup=A database with related tables is open; the chinook sample has them.
Homework=Follow a relationship two levels deep, then return with Alt plus Home.

[step]

Say=One want: from an artist, to the albums, to the tracks, and back. Related tables let one record lead to others.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Alt plus Control plus D, D for DbDo, opens it or brings it forward.
Key=Alt+Control+D
Hear=DbDo
Hear=DbDo ready

[step]

Say=Shift plus R, R for Related, says what this record leads to, changing nothing.
Key=Shift+R
Hear=(the related tables and their counts)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Alt plus Right Arrow goes into the related records.
Key=Alt+Right Arrow
Hear=(the child table, and its first record)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Shift plus Z says where I am now.
Key=Shift+Z
Hear=(the child table, its record count, the filter that ties it to the parent)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Alt plus Right Arrow again goes a level deeper.
Key=Alt+Right Arrow
Hear=(the next table down)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Alt plus Left Arrow comes back a level, as a browser goes back.
Key=Alt+Left Arrow
Hear=(the table one level up)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A planned misstep: three levels deep, and lost. Alt plus Home returns to where I started, from any depth.
Key=Alt+Home
Hear=(the starting table, at the record I left)
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=What this walk taught. I name the command; the reader gives the key.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Go into related records.
Key=
Hear=Alt plus Right Arrow

[step]

Say=Come back a level.
Key=
Hear=Alt plus Left Arrow

[step]

Say=Return to the start.
Key=
Hear=Alt plus Home
